   "scene": "channel",
   "start": 5.22,
   "speech_end": 12.62,
   "end": 14.82,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Below the dam, the spillway channel fills. Thousands of them. Shoulder to shoulder. Staring up at the lights.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "control_room",
   "start": 14.82,
   "speech_end": 19.14,
   "end": 20.34,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The control room still has power. And a radio that reaches farther than any CB.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "dam_radio",
   "start": 20.34,
   "speech_end": 26.22,
   "end": 27.22,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Pine Hollow shelter at Saint Agnes Church remains open. Survivors should keep all lights off.",
   "role": "radio"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "you_lean",
   "start": 27.22,
   "speech_end": 32.19,
   "end": 33.59,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Pine Hollow. Not empty. A shelter. Right on the river.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "dam_radio",
   "start": 33.59,
   "speech_end": 42.048,
   "end": 43.648,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "This is Linda, at Saint Agnes. We have forty-one people here. We need water. Please. Anybody.",
   "role": "mom"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "you_grip",
   "start": 43.648,
   "speech_end": 45.188,
   "end": 47.588,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You'd know that voice anywhere.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "tell_boone",
   "start": 47.588,
   "speech_end": 52.878,
   "end": 54.678,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You tell Boone. Forty-one people. Your mother. Twelve miles downstream.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "boone_tight",
   "start": 54.678,
   "speech_end": 60.918,
   "end": 61.918,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "If I don't open those gates, all of that walks back out of the channel. Toward every town in this county.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "boone_tight",
   "start": 61.918,
   "speech_end": 63.158,
   "end": 64.758,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Including Pine Hollow.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "you_lean",
   "start": 64.758,
   "speech_end": 67.088,
   "end": 68.688,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "He's not wrong. That's the worst part.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "timer",
   "start": 68.688,
   "speech_end": 73.108,
   "end": 74.908,
   "overlay": [
    "time",
    "SUNRISE 6:01 AM"
   ],
   "text": "The floodgates open on a timer. At sunrise. Boone set it himself.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "dani_door",
   "start": 74.908,
   "speech_end": 79.118,
   "end": 80.318,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "There's another way. You taught it to us. No lights, they lose interest.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "rule1",
   "start": 80.318,
   "speech_end": 82.868,
   "end": 84.668,
   "overlay": [
    "rule",
    "RULE 1:",
    "NO LIGHTS AFTER SUNSET"
   ],
   "text": "Rule one. The oldest rule you have.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "dark_plan",
   "start": 84.668,
   "speech_end": 89.648,
   "end": 91.448,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Kill every light on the dam. Let them drift away in the dark. Back into the hills.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "boone_tight",
   "start": 91.448,
   "speech_end": 95.638,
   "end": 96.638,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Scattered is worse than drowned. You can't herd what you can't see.",
